   "date": "2006-12-11T18:33:14-06:00",
   "body": "You can find Zenn Foulhoof at the coordinates 60, 56.  He is just east of Dolanaar.  There is no reputation gain or loss with this quest, although you become an enemy of Teldrassil until you complete the follow-up quest.",
